"},{"pos":9,"ar":"٦","en_gloss":"(6)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"15:6"}]},{"verse_key":"15:7","surah":15,"ayah":7,"ar_uthmani":"لَّوْ مَا تَأْتِينَا بِٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةِ إِن كُنتَ مِنَ ٱلصَّـٰدِقِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Why do you not bring us the angels, if you are telling the truth?’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لَّوْ","en_gloss":"Why","transliteration":"law","verse_key":"15:7"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"15:7"},{"pos":3,"ar":"تَأْتِينَا","en_gloss":"you bring to us","transliteration":"tatīnā","verse_key":"15:7"},{"pos":4,"ar":"بِٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةِ","en_gloss":"the Angels","transliteration":"bil-malāikati","verse_key":"15:7"},{"pos":5,"ar":"إِن","en_gloss":"if","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"15:7"},{"pos":6,"ar":"كُنتَ","en_gloss":"you are","transliteration":"kunta","verse_key":"15:7"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"15:7"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلصَّـٰدِقِينَ","en_gloss":"the truthful","transliteration":"l-ṣādiqīna","verse_key":"15:7"},{"pos":9,"ar":"٧","en_gloss":"(7)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"15:7"}]},{"verse_key":"15:8","surah":15,"ayah":8,"ar_uthmani":"مَا نُنَزِّلُ ٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةَ إِلَّا بِٱلْحَقِّ وَمَا كَانُوٓا۟ إِذًا مُّنظَرِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"But We send down the angels only to bring justice and then these people will not be reprieved.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"15:8"},{"pos":2,"ar":"نُنَزِّلُ","en_gloss":"We send down","transliteration":"nunazzilu","verse_key":"15:8"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةَ","en_gloss":"the Angels","transliteration":"l-malāikata","verse_key":"15:8"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"15:8"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بِٱلْحَقِّ","en_gloss":"with the truth","transliteration":"bil-ḥaqi","verse_key":"15:8"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"15:8"},{"pos":7,"ar":"كَانُوٓا۟","en_